{"kind":"table","sheet":"Results","address":"A1:C6","rows":6,"cols":3,"values":[["id","statement","status"],["A.1","Totality and exactness use the stated small-category, covariant-action, and integral-module conventions.","Known"],["A.2","Every nonempty connected total small category has exact abelian colimits.","Open"],["A.3","For any small category, integral exactness is equivalent to exactness over Q and every F_p jointly.","Proved"],["A.4","The resolving class generated by permutation diagrams is colimit-acyclic under totality and already closed under tensoring with permutation diagrams.","Proved"],["A.5","The column obstruction modules, or the augmentation multiplication image I(M)^2, belong to the proved resolving class.","Open"]]}
